[statement]
The preliminary choices follow the names a condition states, though the
decision order does not. `r`'s condition names `q`, which needs `Y`: `lo`,
the one candidate for `Y`, is chosen for it there, before `X` is reached,
and `X`, decided first, takes `lo`, which answers it; `hi` is not
installed. Contrast
`install-if/the-names-a-condition-states-number-nothing`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:n w v

P:n
V:1

P:r
V:1
i:n q zz

P:q
V:1
D:Y

P:w
V:1
D:X

P:v
V:1
D:Y

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install n 1
install lo 1
install w 1
install v 1
install top 1
